LEMMA L2 (F_{p²} Multiplicative Inverse):
  For α = a + bi ∈ F_{p²} with α ≠ 0:
    α⁻¹ = (a - bi) / (a² + b²)
  where division is modular in F_p.
  
  Proof: (a + bi)(a - bi) = a² + b², and a² + b² ≠ 0 in F_p when α ≠ 0.

LEMMA L3 (Integer Square Root):
  For n ∈ ℤ_{≥0}, integer square root ⌊√n⌋ computable in O(log n) via Newton.
  
